        "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}10\\pi &= \\frac{1}{2}(5)^2\\theta\\\\\\theta &= \\frac{4\\pi}{5}\\\\l &= 5\\left(\\frac{4\\pi}{5}\\right)\\\\l &= 4\\pi\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
